# Route: guide 1 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren (1211
# of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 1 to 12, 47
# quests, 4.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Mulgore): Red Cloud Mesa -> Bloodhoof Village -> Palemane Rock ->
# Winterhoof Water Well -> Bloodhoof Village -> Thunderhorn Water Well ->
# Bloodhoof Village -> Winterhoof Water Well -> Bloodhoof Village ->
# Winterhoof Water Well -> Bloodhoof Village -> The Rolling Plains ->
# Bloodhoof Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Ceasing Operations (98427; Venture
# Co. Clearclutter 12).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 768 Gathering
# Leather; 769 Kodo Hide Bag; 97927 Camping 101: Alchemy; 97928 Camping 101:
# Blacksmithing; 97929 Camping 101: Enchanting; 97930 Camping 101:
# Engineering; 97931 Camping 101: First Aid; 97932 Camping 101: Fishing; 97933
# Camping 101: Herbalism; 97934 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 97935 Camping
# 101: Mining; 97936 Camping 101: Skinning; 97937 Camping 101: Tailoring.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen
# (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Searching for the Lost Satchel (5722),
# Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723).

